WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.315
Listing an apartment used to mean

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.432
filling in form after form.

00:00:04.582 --> 00:00:07.470
On HAMLET, you just tell Horatio about it.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.355
Horatio is our listing assistant.

00:00:09.355 --> 00:00:10.955
Write a short brief,

00:00:10.955 --> 00:00:12.530
the way you'd describe the place

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:13.773
to a friend.

00:00:13.883 --> 00:00:15.228
Bedrooms, bathrooms,

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.108
how many guests,

00:00:16.128 --> 00:00:16.833
what's included,

00:00:16.853 --> 00:00:17.908
and your rate.

00:00:17.928 --> 00:00:20.409
Then tap, generate listing draft.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:22.769
Horatio fills in the form for you.

00:00:22.769 --> 00:00:24.049
The title, the area,

00:00:24.069 --> 00:00:25.609
the rooms, the amenities and

00:00:25.629 --> 00:00:26.675
the price.

00:00:26.785 --> 00:00:29.555
If something's missing, Horatio tells you.

00:00:29.575 --> 00:00:31.130
It never makes things up.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:33.396
You check the draft, then apply it.

00:00:33.506 --> 00:00:35.236
Next, add your photos straight

00:00:35.256 --> 00:00:36.311
from your phone.

00:00:36.331 --> 00:00:37.836
HAMLET optimises them and

00:00:37.856 --> 00:00:39.561
turns them the right way up.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.218
Pick your cover photo.

00:00:41.328 --> 00:00:42.303
Preview what guests will

00:00:42.303 --> 00:00:43.808
pay, confirm you're allowed

00:00:43.828 --> 00:00:45.633
to list it, and submit.

00:00:45.743 --> 00:00:47.048
That's one apartment.

00:00:47.068 --> 00:00:48.668
Got more? Just do it again.

00:00:48.668 --> 00:00:50.468
A short brief and a few

00:00:50.468 --> 00:00:52.010
photos for each one.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:53.370
Then HAMLET checks every

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.175
listing before it goes live,

00:00:55.195 --> 00:00:56.863
so guests can trust it.

00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:59.303
Tell Horatio. Add photos.

00:00:59.323 --> 00:01:02.066
Submit. List your apartments on HAMLET.
